<title>HONG KONG: Hanil Bank launches US$200 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Hanil Bank launches US$200 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Fuji International Finance (HK) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER  HANIL BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$200 MLN  COUPON     6ML+21    MATURITY  12.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	FRN	   ISS PRICE  99.97     RE-OFFER  99.97</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	  CALLS	NONE	LAUNCH    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING   LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES   **</p>
<p> RATING    NONE	  SALES LMTS STANDARD  DENOMS US$500K,1000K</p>
<p> NEG PLG   --	    CRS DEF    --	  FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> GOV LAW   ENGLISH     HOME CTRY  S KOREA   PAY DATE  12.NOV.96</p>
<p> FEES	14BP SPLIT  MGT/UND    7BP	 SELL CON  7BP</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGERS  BARCLAYS DE ZOETE WEDD, FUJI INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>		    FINANCE (HK), LEHMAN BROTHERS, LTCB ASIA AND</p>
<p>		    SANWA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE.</p>
<p> AGENT	    FIRST NATIONAL BANK OF CHICAGO, LONDON BRANCH</p>
<p> PAYING AGENT   KREDIETBANK S.A. LUXEMBOURGEOISE</p>
<p> NOTES   *REDEMPTION PRICE AT 100 PCT.</p>
<p>	   **NO GROUP WILL BE FORMED BUT SYNDICATE BREAK ON</p>
<p>	   OCT 30 AT 3.00PM HONGKONG TIME.</p>
<p>	   ISSUED OFF ITS US$2 BILLION EURO-MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>	   THIS ISSUE IS FULLY UNDERWRITTEN BY THE LEAD MANAGERS.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843 6960</p>
</text>
